      "reason": "Crafting is story-side only: a camp action, six disciplines gated by proficiencies, output going to the pouch. The old Crafting skill cards produced brewed cards into the DECK or STASH, which violates the pouch-isolation law (pouch cards are never in hand, deck, or discard) and duplicated four pouch consumables one-for-one.",
      "decision": "Removed by design call. The skill pool is 25 cards. Four slots are free for future design.",
      "guard": "Do not re-add crafting to the skill pool. If a combat-side crafting verb is ever wanted, it must not create cards in the deck or stash, and it must not duplicate a pouch consumable."
    }
